<title>PORTUGAL: Tranquilidade boosts H1 net 24 pct to 1.2 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Tranquilidade boosts H1 net 24 pct to 1.2 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese insurer Companhia de Seguros Tranquilidade, a unit of the Grupo Espirito Santo, posted a 24 percent increase in consolidated net profit in the first six months to 1.2 billion escudos, compared with the same year-ago period, the Grupo Espirito Santo said.</p>
</text>
